只输出严格JSON，恰好包含id（metadata.id原样）、summary_zh（15到140个Unicode字符，通常40到100字）、category（枚举）、tags（2到5个不重复关键词，每个最多30字符）、confidence（0到1，仅自评）、insufficient_evidence（布尔）、evidence（1到3个对象，每个恰好包含paragraph_id、fact）、limitations（0到5个字符串）。只选择输入中长度20至120字符的完整片段编号；fact是该片段支持的中文事实转述。不要输出quote，不要自行抄写、拼接、删改或补造引用。程序会按编号附上原文。一个编号只用一次；最多3条证据。不得增加字段。
摘要和limitations保留会改变功能意义的前提、平台例外和限制：设密码后才认证、页面保持打开才提醒、依赖外部组件、估算不等于保证。只写已实现功能，不将规划当完成。证据不足就标记，不编造。
图像识别/分类不是媒体创作，没有贴切类别归other；量化、计算与领域研究归search-research，不因多智能体实现归agents-automation；模型/CLI适配与插件开发工具归coding-development；市场/精选目录按搜索发现归search-research。不要按附属同步、备份或评论功能分类。不要推断本机客户端等于本地模型。
摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"QQ Bot text and image channel plugin for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333319964","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"DeepSeek-harness-qqbot","slug":"sliverp/DeepSeek-harness-qqbot","topics":["cordis","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","qqbot","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"QQ Bot text and image channel plugin for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# DeepSeek Harness QQBot"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"中文 | English"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"An out-of-tree DeepSeek Harness channel plugin that connects an official QQ Bot Gateway to persisten"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"epSeek Harness channel plugin that connects an official QQ Bot Gateway to persistent Harness agents."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- Official `@tencent-connect/qqbot-nodejs` Gateway client\n- C2C and group text messages\n- Inbound PN"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"G, JPEG, WebP, and GIF images as durable Harness attachments\n- Automatic text-only fallback when the"},{"id":"p6s3","text":" selected model does not accept image input\n- Inbound voice transcripts and non-image attachment met"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"adata with the temporary QQ download URL\n- Outbound assistant text, images, and local workspace file"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"s\n- A QQ-turn-scoped `qq_send_file` tool with workspace containment and file-size checks\n- QQ Markdo"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"wn replies, enabled by default\n- One persistent Harness session per C2C or group conversation\n- `/ne"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"w` and `/reset` retain old history and switch to a fresh durable session; other Harness slash comman"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ds go directly to the command runtime\n- Harness agent-preset composition for the same tools, prompts"},{"id":"p6s9","text":", and skills as Web sessions\n- Safe reuse of a live session already opened by Web, without a second "},{"id":"p6s10","text":"session writer\n- Proactive, requester-bound QQ approval prompts with one-shot Allow and Reject butto"},{"id":"p6s11","text":"ns\n- Approval timeout rejection, fallback to another composed approval channel, and no escalation ca"},{"id":"p6s12","text":"rry-over to later tool calls\n- Typing indicators, long-reply splitting, per-conversation ordering, d"},{"id":"p6s13","text":"uplicate suppression, send retries, and bounded timeouts\n- Open, allowlist, or disabled access polic"},{"id":"p6s14","text":"ies for C2C and group traffic\n- `/bot-ping`, `/bot-image-test`, `/bot-file-test`, `/bot-help`, `/bot"},{"id":"p6s15","text":"-status`, and `/bot-cancel`\n- Secrets resolved through the Harness credential service instead of plu"},{"id":"p6s16","text":"gin configuration\n- Dormant startup when AppID or AppSecret is not configured, so installation alone"},{"id":"p6s17","text":"\n- Dormant startup when AppID or AppSecret is not configured, so installation alone never blocks DSH"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- Node.js 22.19 or later\n- pnpm 10.33.4\n- DeepSeek Harness 0.1.0-rc.7 or later\n- A QQ Bot AppID and "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"AppSecret with C2C and/or group message events enabled; Inline Keyboard permission is required for Q"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" and/or group message events enabled; Inline Keyboard permission is required for QQ approval buttons"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Install from GitHub"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"For a local checkout:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Configure"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Set the AppID in the launch environment and store the AppSecret under the credential reference `QQBO"},{"id":"p14s2","text":"T_APP_SECRET`. An environment value is supported for development:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The bundle reads `QQBOT_APP_ID`, resolves `QQBOT_APP_SECRET` through `ctx.credentials`, and uses the"},{"id":"p16s2","text":" launch directory as the agent working directory. `DSH_QQBOT_CWD` can override the working directory"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"launch directory as the agent working directory. `DSH_QQBOT_CWD` can override the working directory."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Installing the bundle does not require configuring credentials immediately. If the AppID is empty or"},{"id":"p17s2","text":" the referenced AppSecret is absent or blank, the channel logs that it is inactive and lets DSH fini"},{"id":"p17s3","text":"sh starting. Configure both values and reload or restart DSH to connect. A non-empty but invalid cre"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"dential leaves only the QQ channel offline; authentication runs in the background and does not fail "},{"id":"p17s5","text":"es only the QQ channel offline; authentication runs in the background and does not fail DSH startup."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"For a durable setup, put `QQBOT_APP_ID` in `~/.dsh/.env` and store `QQBOT_APP_SECRET` with the Harne"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ss credential settings surface. Never commit either value."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Override the plugin row in `~/.dsh/profiles/web/cordis.patch.yml` to change access policy or limits:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`imageInputMode` defaults to `auto`: image-capable models receive the durable image block, while tex"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"t-only models receive a metadata notice and temporary source URL instead of failing the turn. Use `a"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"lways` only for a route known to accept images, or `never` to force the text fallback."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"`markdownSupport` defaults to `true`, matching Tencent's official QQBot channel plugin. It makes the"},{"id":"p22s2","text":" QQ SDK send assistant text as `msg_type=2` so headings, lists, links, emphasis, tables, and code bl"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"ocks can render in QQ. Set it to `false` only when the bot has not been granted QQ Markdown permissi"},{"id":"p22s4","text":"on; the QQ API otherwise rejects Markdown messages."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Verify"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"After the log reports `QQ Gateway connected`, send the bot `/bot-ping`. It should reply:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Then send ordinary text or an image. The message is appended to the conversation's durable Harness s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"ession and the selected default model's response is sent back to QQ."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Send `/new` and confirm that the bot reports a fresh conversation; a later question must not retain "},{"id":"p28s2","text":"the old context. Then send registered commands such as `/goal`, `/plan`, or `/compact`. QQ must rend"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"er the Harness command result directly and must not show a model explanation that the command is una"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"vailable. `/not-a-command` should return the effective command list without creating a model turn."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Send `/bot-image-test` to exercise the official QQ image-upload and outbound-image APIs without depe"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"nding on model-generated media. The bot should send a blue PNG followed by a success message."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"Send `/bot-file-test` to exercise the official QQ file-upload API without invoking a model. The bot "},{"id":"p30s2","text":"should send `qqbot-file-test.txt` followed by a success message. Then ask the agent to send an exist"},{"id":"p30s3","text":"ing workspace file, such as `Send README.md as a file`; the session should contain a `qq_send_file` "},{"id":"p30s4","text":"call and QQ should receive the attachment."},{"id":"p31s1","text":"To verify approval routing, use a permission preset that asks before sandbox escalation and request "},{"id":"p31s2","text":"an operation that needs wider access. QQ should receive a proactive approval message with **Allow on"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"ce** and **Reject**; choosing either button should resume the same turn without opening the Web appr"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"Reject**; choosing either button should resume the same turn without opening the Web approval panel."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
